                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "忙しくて友人の結婚式に参加できないなんて、行けない。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
